          "relation": "states",
          "snippet": {
            "line": 154,
            "text": "theorem pressure_moment_reconstructed {p g ρ : ℝ → ℝ} (P : ℝ)\n    (hp : ContDiff ℝ ∞ p) (hsp : HasCompactSupport p)\n    (hg : Continuous g) (hsg : HasCompactSupport g)\n    (hρ : Continuous ρ) (hsρ : HasCompactSupport ρ)\n    (hd : ∀ r, deriv p r = g r - ρ r * P) :\n    moment 1 p = -(1 / 2 : ℝ) * moment 2 g + (moment 2 ρ / 2) * P"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
